    "Per baseline-cargo-w0.txt, json rfc8259's ✳️any diff/mutations component.rs previously failed to compile (E0432 unresolved import protocol::DiffAlgebra) due to another concurrent session's in-flight DiffAlgebra relocation; that session's fix has since landed (confirmed by a live cargo check run during this unit's work: zero DiffAlgebra-related errors remain anywhere in the crate). i-json's schema delegates via pure `pub use ...::any::schema::*` and never touches diff/mutations directly, so it was never exposed to this gap regardless. The only cargo check errors touching 🔣json now are the two expected E0433 'cannot find i_json in subsets' errors (composer aggregator + engine::register(), both edited by this unit) -- the documented glue.rs-not-yet-applied state other W3 units are also in. One unrelated pre-existing error remains crate-wide: gltf's json export serializer (JsonValue vs serde_json::Value mismatch, not touched by this unit)."
  ],
